<section class="block on-soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><h2>What we do for charities</h2><p>Fixed-scope pieces of work with a clear question, a clear price and a clear end. Most take six to twelve weeks.</p></div>
    <ul class="services">
      <li><h3>Strategic review and critical-friend report</h3><p>One question, answered with evidence: what should you realistically invest in next, and what should you stop or defer? Findings with a confidence rating, recommendations in order, and decisions ready to minute.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Theory of Change and impact framework</h3><p>The thread from purpose to programmes, programmes to outcomes, outcomes to evidence. With the gaps rated, so a small team knows where to start.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Income strategy and cases for support</h3><p>A costed income model, a funder pipeline, and cases for support that are honest about what is still emerging. Trusts, corporates, major donors, commissioning and trading.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Governance, structures and options appraisal</h3><p>Charity structures and trading subsidiaries, mergers and partnerships, property and premises, and whether to become a grant-giving foundation.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Market and stakeholder research</h3><p>Structured interviews, surveys and focus groups with the people who know your organisation best, including the people you serve.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Interim and fractional leadership</h3><p>Interim chief executive, director of development or marketing when you need a steady hand for a defined period.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

